# game/events.rpy:24
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_0_fc8010d2:

    # k "Mr. [mc]." with d
    k "[mc]先生。" with d

# game/events.rpy:25
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_0_1ef94384:

    # k "Should you need my assistance in guiding you through your first steps at our Academy, I'm here to help you with the process."
    k "如果您在学院的第一步需要我协助引导，我随时可以帮您熟悉这个流程。"

# game/events.rpy:26
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_0_0afe6f09:

    # k "Do you have any questions about your role and the tasks you could be doing at the Academy?"
    k "关于您的职责，以及您在学院可能承担的任务，您有什么问题吗？"

# game/events.rpy:34
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_b79ba5e8:

    # mc "Yeah, what exactly should I be doing here? Or what's expected of me?" with d
    mc "有，我到底该在这里做什么？或者说，你们期待我做什么？" with d

# game/events.rpy:35
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_c8bb7187:

    # mc "Do I just sit here and wait for things to happen? Or...?"
    mc "我只要坐在这儿等事情发生就行？还是说……？"

# game/events.rpy:37
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_131e90df:

    # k "Don't worry, sir. Allow me to explain it to you..."
    k "别担心，先生。请让我为您解释……"

# game/events.rpy:38
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_1651bf70:

    # k "The best way to approach your duties is to separate the daily period in three parts."
    k "最好的做法，是把一天分成三个时段。"

# game/events.rpy:40
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_15aa540f:

    # k "The first period is the '[tvar]' — before classes have begun."
    k "第一个时段是「[tvar]」——开课之前。"

# game/events.rpy:41
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_c5ff0d0e:

    # k "Most of our students haven't arrived yet, and teachers are still getting settled within their classrooms. So, this is the best period to decide how we'll conduct our activities for the day."
    k "这时我们大多数学生还没到，老师们也还在教室里安顿。所以这是决定当天如何开展活动的最佳时段。"

# game/events.rpy:42
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_3051786e:

    # k "Many options related to managing the Academy are only available during this period."
    k "许多与学院管理相关的选项，只在这个时段可用。"

# game/events.rpy:48
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_c3d96e77:

    # k "You'll be making most of these decisions through the Academy Report Book — usually located at the right-hand side of your desk."
    k "这些决定大多要通过学院报告册来做——它通常放在您办公桌的右手边。"

# game/events.rpy:54
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_1384084e:

    # k "The next period is '[tvar]' — which is when our students have arrived and, consequently, our viewers will start to look for interesting situations."
    k "第二个时段是「[tvar]」——这时学生已经到校，我们的观众也会开始寻找有趣的场面。"

# game/events.rpy:60
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_a02f4d4f:

    # k "During this period, you should be on the lookout for any notification on your laptop, as it can show you if there's anything worth looking through our cameras."
    k "在这个时段，您要留意笔记本电脑上的任何通知，它会告诉您摄像系统里有没有值得一看的内容。"

# game/events.rpy:61
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_202901b3:

    # k "Your device has already been set up within our intranet and connected to the various cameras at the Academy."
    k "您的设备已经在我们的内网里设置好了，并接入了学院的各个摄像机。"

# game/events.rpy:62
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_76b0d49d:

    # k "There, you can check to see if anything that would require your attention is currently happening."
    k "在那里，您可以查看当前是否正在发生需要您关注的事。"

# game/events.rpy:67
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_7d43d124:

    # k "And, finally, there is the '[tvar]' period."
    k "最后，是「[tvar]」时段。"

# game/events.rpy:68
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_f6b51a35:

    # k "Which is where we wind down our activities for the day and deal with any outstanding issues that weren't resolved during it."
    k "我们在这个时段结束当天的活动，并处理当天没能解决的遗留问题。"

# game/events.rpy:69
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_8ba57600:

    # k "The most notable case that I can think of right now is if you decided to have a conversation with a student, they'll most likely arrive at the office during this period."
    k "我现在能想到最典型的情况是：如果您决定和某个学生谈话，她很可能会在这个时段来到办公室。"

# game/events.rpy:70
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_709ee30a:

    # k "But keep in mind that, in order to call a student to the office, you'll have to do so before the '[tvar]' period since, by then, they'll have left the facilities already."
    k "但请记住，要把学生叫到办公室，必须在「[tvar]」时段之前就通知，因为到那时她们已经离校了。"

# game/events.rpy:73
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_155211d7:

    # mc "Okay, so, early morning is deciding things, during classes is the time to check on the cameras, and after classes is to deal with any remaining problems." with d
    mc "好，也就是说：早上做决定，上课时间查看摄像机，下课后处理剩下的事。" with d

# game/events.rpy:74
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_46fe282c:

    # mc "Got it..."
    mc "明白了……"

# game/events.rpy:77
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_7fe75bd8:

    # k "Do you need anything else, Sir?" with d
    k "先生，您还需要别的吗？" with d

# game/events.rpy:87
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_cb94cd88:

    # mc "Uhm... Not right now." with d
    mc "呃……暂时不用了。" with d

# game/events.rpy:88
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_90ce0d04:

    # mc "I think I'll just check a few things first, then I'll get back to you."
    mc "我想我先看几样东西，然后再回来找您。"

# game/events.rpy:90
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_a662ee0f:

    # k "Should you need anything, please let me know."
    k "有任何需要，请告诉我。"

# game/events.rpy:98
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_5cd02e24:

    # mc "No, I'm fine.{w} Let's just get things started!" with d
    mc "不，我没事。{w}我们开始吧！" with d

# game/events.rpy:103
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_c08c020d:

    # k "Certainly." with d
    k "当然。" with d

# game/events.rpy:107
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_d35943e0:

    # k "In that case.{w} What do you need of me, Sir?" with d
    k "既然如此。{w}先生，您需要我做什么？" with d

# game/events.rpy:111
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_1a8676e7:

    # k "Mr. [mc].{w} What do you need of me?" with d
    k "[mc]先生。{w}您需要我做什么？" with d

# game/events.rpy:121
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_201f7622:

    # mc "I'd like to call a student to the office." with d
    mc "我想叫一个学生到办公室来。" with d

# game/events.rpy:124
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_1860a0bd:

    # k "Certainly..."
    k "当然……"

# game/events.rpy:126
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_72d5d803:

    # k "Which student should I call?" with d
    k "您要叫哪位学生？" with d

# game/events.rpy:136
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_007617aa:

    # k "Of course, sir. Once I find[tvar2] [calledstudent.name], I'll let [tvar] know you wanted to see [tvar]." with d
    k "当然，先生。等我找到[tvar2] [calledstudent.name]，我会告知[tvar]您想见[tvar]。" with d

# game/events.rpy:140
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_8a298d35:

    # mc "Actually, I changed my mind. Don't call anyone." with d
    mc "算了，我改主意了。别叫任何人。" with d

# game/events.rpy:142
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_45529ac7:

    # k "Of course, sir.{w} Let me know if you need anything else."
    k "当然，先生。{w}还有别的需要请告诉我。"

# game/events.rpy:145
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_b812cee6:

    # k "Unfortunately, most of our students have already left the Academy." with d
    k "很遗憾，我们大多数学生已经离校了。" with d

# game/events.rpy:146
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_ef791c00:

    # k "If you need to speak to someone in particular, we'll have to schedule for another day."
    k "如果您需要和特定的人谈话，只能改到别的日子了。"

# game/events.rpy:148
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_88f3b528:

    # mc "Yeah, you're right."
    mc "是啊，你说得对。"

# game/events.rpy:152
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_3e831e76:

    # mc "That's all for now." with d
    mc "暂时就这些。" with d

# game/events.rpy:154
translate schinese kiyomi_first_office_talk_80f91ba3:

    # k "Of course, sir."
    k "当然，先生。"

# game/events.rpy:178
translate schinese bat_reminder_f7883cfb:

    # k "Sir. We have recently confiscated Miss [suzu.name]'s baseball bat." with d
    k "先生。我们最近没收了[suzu.name]小姐的棒球棒。" with d

# game/events.rpy:181
translate schinese bat_reminder_5c760e8d:

    # mc "Right... [suz]'s bat."
    mc "对……[suz]的球棒。"

# game/events.rpy:182
translate schinese bat_reminder_fb44d589:

    # mc "I was supposed to decide what to do with it, right?"
    mc "我该决定怎么处置它，对吧？"

# game/events.rpy:184
translate schinese bat_reminder_22a94b4c:

    # mc "We did?"
    mc "我们决定了吗？"

# game/events.rpy:186
translate schinese bat_reminder_c9776293:

    # k "I did, to be more precise, sir. After it was removed from her possession by Miss [sat]."
    k "是我决定的，先生。在[sat]小姐把它从她手里收走之后。"

# game/events.rpy:188
translate schinese bat_reminder_16b05a67:

    # mc "Oh... right! During the spanking session we had in my introduction."
    mc "哦……对！在我那场介绍里的打屁股环节。"

# game/events.rpy:193
translate schinese bat_reminder_e1946810:

    # k "Correct."
    k "没错。"

# game/events.rpy:196
translate schinese bat_reminder_eb67416d:

    # k "I believe you should call her to the office and decide what to do with the object." with d
    k "我认为您应该把她叫到办公室，决定怎么处理那个东西。" with d

# game/events.rpy:197
translate schinese bat_reminder_e6365dd7:

    # k "The girl is quite fond of the item, so I believe you'll be able to give it back in return for some form of favor from her."
    k "那女孩很喜欢那个东西，所以您应该能用它换回她的某种回报。"

# game/events.rpy:200
translate schinese bat_reminder_0785d672:

    # mc "Oh... I see where you're going with this. Okay, thanks for the reminder, [k]. I'll see what I can do about it." with d
    mc "哦……我懂你的意思了。好，谢谢你提醒，[k]。我会想办法的。" with d

# game/events.rpy:202
translate schinese bat_reminder_80f91ba3:

    # k "Of course, sir."
    k "当然，先生。"

# game/events.rpy:213
translate schinese bat_reminder_fc7e3769:

    # k "Sir. You have recently acquired one of our female students' intimate piece of clothing." with d
    k "先生。您最近获得了一件我们某位女学生的贴身衣物。" with d

# game/events.rpy:215
translate schinese bat_reminder_c7bfe745:

    # mc "Their panties, you mean?"
    mc "你是说她们的内裤？"

# game/events.rpy:217
translate schinese bat_reminder_e1946810_1:

    # k "Correct."
    k "没错。"

# game/events.rpy:218
translate schinese bat_reminder_2b69da05:

    # k "I have taken the liberty to organize them under your desk and assign to which student they belong to. This should provide some ease of access for you to decide what to do with them."
    k "我自作主张把它们整理好放在您的桌子下面，并标注了分别属于谁。这样您处置起来会方便些。"

# game/events.rpy:220
translate schinese bat_reminder_d68c6f81:

    # mc "'Ease of access'? Do you think I'll just jerk off to their panties? What kind of pervert do you think I am?"
    mc "「方便」？你以为我会对着她们的内裤打手枪？您觉得我是什么变态？"

# game/events.rpy:222
translate schinese bat_reminder_c768938c:

    # k "That's... not what I expect you to do with them, sir."
    k "呃……我并不认为您会那样使用它们，先生。"

# game/events.rpy:224
translate schinese bat_reminder_53ee8341:

    # k "Some of our viewers are willing to offer large sums of money for our students' 'panties'."
    k "我们有些观众愿意出大价钱买我们学生的「内裤」。"

# game/events.rpy:225
translate schinese bat_reminder_dcc7a007:

    # k "Should you be able to acquire one, I'm sure the Board will have a buyer ready and willing make an offer."
    k "如果您能弄到一条，我敢肯定董事会已经有买家准备好出价了。"

# game/events.rpy:227
translate schinese bat_reminder_470c2c74:

    # mc "An offer to buy one of our students' panties?"
    mc "出价买我们学生的内裤？"

# game/events.rpy:229
translate schinese bat_reminder_e1946810_2:

    # k "Correct."
    k "没错。"

# game/events.rpy:231
translate schinese bat_reminder_252571c7:

    # mc "... Alright. I'll think about it."
    mc "……好吧。我会考虑的。"

# game/events.rpy:233
translate schinese bat_reminder_88ae75e6:

    # k "Of course."
    k "当然。"

# game/events.rpy:245
translate schinese clubs_explanation_4030a6aa:

    # k "Sir. I'm sure you've noticed already, but there's a section on the Academy Report Book called 'Academic Programs'." with d
    k "先生。我敢肯定您已经注意到了，学院报告册里有一个叫「学业项目」的板块。"with d

# game/events.rpy:246
translate schinese clubs_explanation_e047108b:

    # k "Those are various extracurricular activities that we or the students themselves organize, in order to better navigate through their academic period."
    k "那是我们或学生自己组织的各种课外活动，目的是更好地度过他们的学期。"

# game/events.rpy:247
translate schinese clubs_explanation_5ff73237:

    # k "Please, take your time to examine and familiarize yourself with their purpose. They might prove useful at some point."
    k "请花点时间研究并熟悉它们的用途。它们迟早会有用。"

# game/events.rpy:249
translate schinese clubs_explanation_dc16ebcd:

    # mc "Got it."
    mc "明白了。"

# game/events.rpy:260
translate schinese low_grades_students_daily_reminder_25da6125:

    # k "Sir. A significant number of students have scored lower grades than our established threshold." with d
    k "先生，有相当多的学生成绩低于我们设定的分数线。" with d

# game/events.rpy:261
translate schinese low_grades_students_daily_reminder_fe0997e1:

    # k "This could be a useful opportunity for you to take advantage of the situation."
    k "这可能是您利用局势的一个好机会。"

# game/events.rpy:262
translate schinese low_grades_students_daily_reminder_ccbd5fc9:

    # k "Remember, it is encouraged for you to exchange certain... 'favors' in order to increase a student's grade."
    k "记住，鼓励您通过交换某些……「好处」来提高学生成绩。"

# game/events.rpy:264
translate schinese low_grades_students_daily_reminder_3ceb16c6:

    # k "I also believe that some of our main targets scored low on their latest test results."
    k "我还认为我们几个主要目标的最新测验成绩也不理想。"

# game/events.rpy:266
translate schinese low_grades_students_daily_reminder_d328e7d1:

    # mc "Interesting. I'll take a look. Thanks, [k]."
    mc "有意思。我去看看。谢谢，[k]。"

# game/events.rpy:277
translate schinese striked_students_daily_reminder_97784dc0:

    # k "Sir. Make sure to take a look at our student records. Some of them have acquired strikes recently." with d
    k "先生。请务必查看学生档案，有些学生最近获得了记过。" with d

# game/events.rpy:278
translate schinese striked_students_daily_reminder_9fcd0d96:

    # k "I believe it might be a good idea to make use of the situation to further our objectives."
    k "我认为可以利用这个局势来推进我们的目标。"

# game/events.rpy:280
translate schinese striked_students_daily_reminder_31b208f4:

    # mc "Sure, I'll take a look. Thanks, [k]."
    mc "好，我去看看。谢谢，[k]。"

# game/events.rpy:354
translate schinese location_jump_event_check_3a845432:

    # mct "(Nope... Nothing happening here.)" with d
    mct "（没有……这儿什么都没发生。）" with d

# game/events.rpy:475
translate schinese exam_review_95af901b:

    # k "Here are the exam's result, sir." with d
    k "先生，这是这次测验的结果。" with d

# game/events.rpy:478
translate schinese exam_review_67fdd9a2:

    # mc "Let's see the exam results..." with d
    mc "我们来看看测验结果……" with d

# game/events.rpy:490
translate schinese exam_review_3472ec30:

    # k "More than half of our students scored higher than the threshold we've set for a success." with d
    k "我们超过一半的学生成绩高于我们设定的成功线。" with d

# game/events.rpy:491
translate schinese exam_review_cae3b014:

    # k "While the students are pleased with the result, this leaves us with few opportunities to exploit their situations."
    k "学生们对这个结果很满意，但这让我们可以利用她们处境的机会变少了。"

# game/events.rpy:493
translate schinese exam_review_1819af9c:

    # k "Perhaps increasing the difficulty on our next exam might cause a different outcome."
    k "也许提高下次测验的难度，能带来不同的结果。"

# game/events.rpy:497
translate schinese exam_review_a644e832:

    # k "More than three quarter of our students failed to achieve a desirable result." with d
    k "我们超过四分之三的学生没能取得理想成绩。" with d

# game/events.rpy:498
translate schinese exam_review_e409a7d7:

    # k "This has its benefits, since they'll be more reliant on finding {i}other{/i} methods of increasing their grades and might come to you for aid. Which could prove to be very valuable."
    k "这也有好处，因为她们会更依赖寻找{i}其他{/i}提高成绩的方法，也可能来找你求助。这可能非常有价值。"

# game/events.rpy:499
translate schinese exam_review_de6828b6:

    # k "On the other hand, it's expected that they'll be dissatisfied with such an outcome and show rebellious behavior if issues aren't fixed or dealt with in some capacity."
    k "另一方面，可以预料她们会对这种结果不满，如果问题没有解决或得到处理，她们会表现出叛逆行为。"

# game/events.rpy:503
translate schinese exam_review_b5acf586:

    # k "Most of our students scored around the average mark. The grades were around what we expected them to be." with d
    k "我们大多数学生的成绩都在平均线附近。和我们预期的差不多。" with d

# game/events.rpy:504
translate schinese exam_review_2253f864:

    # k "As a result, the students shouldn't think much of it."
    k "所以学生们不会太当回事。"

# game/events.rpy:517
translate schinese exam_review_9525119d:

    # k "With that, we conclude our weekly activities. Good job, sir." with d
    k "至此，本周的活动就结束了。您做得很好，先生。" with d

# game/events.rpy:519
translate schinese exam_review_44c6ef3b:

    # mc "Thanks. See you next week, [k]."
    mc "谢谢。下周见，[k]。"

# game/events.rpy:521
translate schinese exam_review_06bc8804:

    # k "Likewise."
    k "彼此彼此。"

# game/events.rpy:574
translate schinese weekly_exam_hub_old_ca0eab9d:

    # k "Here are the exams's result, sir." with d
    k "先生，这是这次测验的结果。" with d

# game/events.rpy:586
translate schinese weekly_exam_hub_old_4e7f07ad:

    # k "Also, the students were quite pleased with the difficulty of the exam. However, as you might've noticed, due to their grades, this leaves us with few opportunities to exploit their situation." with d
    k "而且学生们对这次测验的难度相当满意。不过，正如您可能已经注意到的，由于她们的成绩，这让我们可以利用她们处境的机会变少了。" with d

# game/events.rpy:590
translate schinese weekly_exam_hub_old_a3f5f694:

    # k "Since we've had an exam of average difficulty, the grades were around what we expected them to be." with d
    k "由于这次测验难度中等，成绩和预期差不多。" with d

# game/events.rpy:591
translate schinese weekly_exam_hub_old_5d930add:

    # k "As a result, the students weren't surprised by it, but they also didn't do great either."
    k "所以学生们并不意外，但也没考得太好。"

# game/events.rpy:594
translate schinese weekly_exam_hub_old_da7c95bb:

    # k "As you could see from the results, due to an increased difficulty, many of the students failed to achieve a significant result." with d
    k "从结果可以看出，由于难度提升，很多学生没能取得好成绩。" with d

# game/events.rpy:595
translate schinese weekly_exam_hub_old_feeb301e:

    # k "This has its benefits, since they'll be more reliant on finding {i}other{/i} methods of increasing their grades and might come to you for aid."
    k "这也有好处，因为她们会更依赖寻找{i}其他{/i}提高成绩的方法，也可能来找你求助。"

# game/events.rpy:596
translate schinese weekly_exam_hub_old_fa2cf563:

