    # "Students" "{size=-8}I have a feeling this one will be the hardest yet...{p}Have you studied anything?{p}Not really... I skipped [hidetoshi.surname]'s last class." with d
    "Students" "{size=-8}我有预感这次会是到目前为止最难的一次……{p}你复习了吗?{p}没有……我翘了[hidetoshi.surname]的上一节课。" with d

