# game/events.rpy:7124
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_4823a995:

    # k "However, I'll give you a brief step-by-step on how you should take on the role of the Chief Academic Officer for our Academy." with d
    k "不过，我先简单分几步说明你该如何担任我们学院的教务主任。" with d

