# game/events.rpy:7129
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_ba5bd0eb:

    # k "First, as I'm sure you're well aware already, our main goal here is to make the Board happy.{w} So any action that you'd think would increase the satisfaction the Board has with our Program, would be one worth pursuing." with d
    k "第一，你应该也很清楚，我们这里的主要目标是让董事会满意。{w}所以任何你认为能提升董事会对我们这个项目满意度的事，都值得去做。" with d

# game/events.rpy:7130
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_a60f1b5d:

    # k "Second, is that our 'Main Targets' are our most important assets, and you should try to maximize your interactions with them.{w} Doing so will make the Board and, our viewers, very interested in your performance."
    k "第二，我们的「主要目标」是最重要的资产，你应该尽可能多地与她们互动。{w}这么做会让董事会以及……我们的观众对你的表现非常感兴趣。"

# game/events.rpy:7131
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_e485cb9b:

    # k "And Third, is that, at least for now, we'll try to maintain a low profile and not alert the students as to what our real intentions are.{w} So a moderate amount of caution is advised, and we'll try to appear as a normal Academy."
    k "第三，至少目前我们尽量保持低调，不要让学生察觉我们真正的意图。{w}所以适度的谨慎是必要的，我们会尽量表现得像一所普通的学院。"

