translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_e4fd00cc:

    # em "But... N-now?! I haven't prepared for it or anything! It's a bit sudden, d-don't you think?"
    em "可是……现、现在？！我完全没准备好啊！太突然了，不、不是吗？"

# game/events.rpy:18351
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_ee0f5dfa:

    # mc "What? Are you scared now? I thought you wanted it."
    mc "怎么？你现在怕了？我以为你想要的。"

# game/events.rpy:18353
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_d0f27949:

    # em "I do!"
    em "我想要！"

# game/events.rpy:18358
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_266df3d6:

    # em "I just... thought we'd talk it over first."
    em "我只是……以为我们会先商量一下。"

# game/events.rpy:18359
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_3fff6250:

    # em "... But, if you want to, we can... do it."
    em "……不过，如果你愿意的话，我们倒是可以……做。"

# game/events.rpy:18364
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_2c297f2b:

    # mc "Looks like you've come prepared as well. You're a bit exposed down there." with d
    mc "看来你也有准备了。你下面露出来了一点哦。" with d

# game/events.rpy:18368
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_25727d55:

    # em "Y-yes."
    em "是、是的。"

# game/events.rpy:18369
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_3ede5d79:

    # em "I've been without it throughout the day, like you told me to."
    em "我照你说的，一整天都没穿。"

# game/events.rpy:18370
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_2b901b88:

    # em "I just hope no one caught a glimpse of me. I've been so paranoid about it."
    em "我只希望没人看到我。我一直提心吊胆的。"

# game/events.rpy:18374
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_87e26eb2:

    # mc "Good girl."
    mc "乖。"

# game/events.rpy:18376
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_5bedfac7:

    # mc "Unfortunately, it won't happen today." with d
    mc "很遗憾，今天不行了。" with d

# game/events.rpy:18384
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_ba413444:

    # em "W-what? Again?"
    em "什、什么？又不行？"

# game/events.rpy:18385
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_cfbeb350:

    # em "You need to stop teasing me like this, it's so mean!"
    em "你别这样吊我胃口，太坏了！"

# game/events.rpy:18386
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_38ad52fd:

    # em "This is like, the third time now!"
    em "这都第三次了！"

# game/events.rpy:18388
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_a54de9eb:

    # mc "Now now... Don't get hasty."
    mc "好了好了……别着急。"

# game/events.rpy:18389
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_2f957b17:

    # mc "I'm not teasing you this time. Well, maybe a bit, but, this is exactly why I called you here."
    mc "这次我不是在吊你胃口。嗯，也许有一点，但这正是我叫你来的原因。"

# game/events.rpy:18390
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_0342c9de:

    # mc "To let you know that the next time we're alone, it'll probably be {i}it.{/i}"
    mc "就是告诉你，下次我们独处的时候，大概就{i}真的是{/i}了。"

# game/events.rpy:18392
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_d7a70165:

    # em "R-really? You promise this time?"
    em "真、真的？这次你保证？"

# game/events.rpy:18394
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_53c966f4:

    # mc "Yes, really. I have made all of the preparations."
    mc "真的。我已经做好全部准备了。"

# game/events.rpy:18399
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_4d87faa8:

    # em "{xpr}*giggles*{/xpr} G-good. Last time I was in charge of planning things, it didn't go too well."
    em "{xpr}*偷笑*{/xpr} 好、好。上次由我来主导安排的时候，结果可不怎么好。"

# game/events.rpy:18401
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_3212d6d9:

    # mc "I know, but, like I said, we don't need to worry about that anymore. Everything will go just as planned, and no distractions will take us out of the moment."
    mc "我知道，但就像我说的，我们已经不用再担心那个了。一切都会按计划进行，不会有任何干扰把我们拉出这一刻。"

# game/events.rpy:18402
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_70cc2ec8:

    # mc "It'll just be me and you."
    mc "就只有我和你。"

# game/events.rpy:18409
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_ccf24088:

    # ha "{size=-6}{xpr}*whispering*{/xpr} Yo... What the fuck? This motherfucker is never this romantic with me!" with d
    ha "{size=-6}{xpr}*低声说*{/xpr} 喂……搞什么？这家伙对我可从来没这么浪漫过！" with d

# game/events.rpy:18410
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_1b286d77:

    # ha "{size=-6}{xpr}*whispering*{/xpr} Man, that's what I get for not playing the 'innocent virgin girlfriend' role."
    ha "{size=-6}{xpr}*低声说*{/xpr} 唉，这就是我不去演「天真处女女友」的下场。"

# game/events.rpy:18413
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_5b761714:

    # em "... Y-yeah, I can't wait." with d
    em "……真、真的，我等不及了。" with d

# game/events.rpy:18415
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_86f9544b:

    # mc "Don't worry, it won't be long now."
    mc "别担心，很快就好。"

# game/events.rpy:18416
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_1517cd13:

    # mc "One of these days, I'll call for you and then, it'll be time."
    mc "总有一天我会把你叫过来，到时候就差不多了。"

# game/events.rpy:18418
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_38703f1f:

    # em "W-when? And... where?"
    em "什、什么时候？还有……在哪里？"

# game/events.rpy:18422
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_f42a5535:

    # mc "Oh? I thought you wanted it to be a surprise? I like to keep you guessing."
    mc "哦？我还以为你想搞个惊喜呢。我喜欢让你猜不透。"

# game/events.rpy:18426
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_72c075ac:

    # em "I... Y-yeah, it's exciting, but I think it's best we plan this the right way."
    em "我……对、对，是很让人兴奋，但我觉得最好还是好好规划一下。"

# game/events.rpy:18430
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_347849f7:

    # mc "I know, you're right."
    mc "我知道，你说得对。"

# game/events.rpy:18431
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_2ed81bd5:

    # mc "So, I was thinking we should keep to our original idea. That's why, I'm preparing for it to happen at an empty classroom, during one of the weekdays."
    mc "所以我在想，我们还是按原来的想法来。正因如此，我准备在某个工作日的空教室里进行。"

# game/events.rpy:18435
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_b4be1bbe:

    # em "During the weekdays? What about everyone else?"
    em "工作日？那其他人怎么办？"

# game/events.rpy:18437
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_d43ea38d:

    # mc "It'll be after classes. And don't worry, I can have [k] making sure no one makes their way to the floor we'll be at."
    mc "会是在放学后。而且别担心，我可以让[k]确保没人到我们所在的楼层来。"

# game/events.rpy:18442
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_a1bfecd6:

    # mc "We'll be free to do as we please, just like you wanted it to."
    mc "我们就能随心所欲，就像你希望的那样。"

# game/events.rpy:18444
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_222a2a0b:

    # em "Y-yeah... That sounds, really exciting."
    em "对、对……听起来真的让人兴奋。"

# game/events.rpy:18446
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_a0fbc09a:

    # em "I can't believe we'll finally..." with d
    em "真不敢相信我们终于……" with d

# game/events.rpy:18451
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_a46cc936:

    # mc "You look so cute when you're nervous."
    mc "你紧张的时候看起来好可爱。"

# game/events.rpy:18453
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_76531eb1:

    # em "S-stop making fun of me! This is important for me..."
    em "别、别取笑我！这对我很重要……"

# game/events.rpy:18455
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_0bbeaaff:

    # mc "I know, I'm not making fun of you."
    mc "我知道，我没有在取笑你。"

# game/events.rpy:18457
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_f0c19c1a:

    # mc "You know... I think there's a side of you I haven't seen yet. And I'm excited to discover it."
    mc "你知道吗……我觉得你还有一面我没见过。而我迫不及待想去发现它。"

# game/events.rpy:18458
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_3ac7c7d0:

    # mc "I'm sure you'll let it out when I'm inside of you, at last..."
    mc "我敢肯定，等我进入你体内的时候，你终于会把它释放出来……"

# game/events.rpy:18461
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_e338ff80:

    # em "M-me too..."
    em "我、我也……"

# game/events.rpy:18464
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_224f840a:

    # mc "That's my girl."
    mc "这才是我的女孩。"

# game/events.rpy:18467
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_602ae805:

    # em "All this talk has made me a bit... Y-you know..." with d
    em "说了这么多，我都有点……你、你知道的……" with d

# game/events.rpy:18469
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_6af27af8:

    # em "M-maybe I can make you feel good...? With... my... mouth?"
    em "也、也许我可以用……我的……嘴让你舒服一点……？"

# game/events.rpy:18486
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_57c9cee0:

    # em "What? What was that?" with d
    em "什么？你说什么？" with d

# game/events.rpy:18488
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_1d2928f8:

    # mct "(Fuck, she's terrible at hiding.)" with d
    mct "（靠，她藏得也太差劲了。）" with d

# game/events.rpy:18493
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_2ebb8e3f:

    # mc "Uhm... it... was nothing. Rats, maybe."
    mc "呃……没、没什么。可能是老鼠吧。"

# game/events.rpy:18498
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_1567a513:

    # em "RATS?!" with hpunch
    em "老鼠？！" with hpunch

# game/events.rpy:18500
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_b188583c:

    # mct "(Shit! I made it even worse.)"
    mct "（糟了！我越描越黑了。）"

