translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_5d6bfbf5:

    # mc "It's just this old furniture makes a lot of cracking noises and stuff. Old stuff, you know how it is."
    mc "只是这些老家具会发出很多噼啪声之类的。老东西嘛，你懂的。"

# game/events.rpy:18513
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_f768a95b:

    # em "... R-right."
    em "……对、对。"

# game/events.rpy:18518
translate schinese Haruka_Sneaking_Office_c3090893:

    # mc "Now, as much as I can't really refuse your offer, I think we should save ourselves for the big day ahead of us." with d
    mc "这样吧，虽然我实在没法拒绝你的提议，但我觉得还是留到那个大日子再说吧。" with d

