    k "先生。有件事需要您处理。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23497
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_ae8eae10:

    # k "We have recorded footage of suspicious activity just outside the Academy."
    k "我们录到了学院外可疑活动的影像。"

# game/events.rpy:23499
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_0ff7d4ad:

    # mc "Outside the Academy? Show it to me."
    mc "学院外？给我看。"

# game/events.rpy:23501
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_0a0ab5b5:

    # k "Certainly."
    k "当然。"

# game/events.rpy:23510
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_922d5847:

    # mc "Who's that handsome fella? Oh wait that's me!" with d
    mc "那个帅小伙是谁？哦等等，那是我！" with d

# game/events.rpy:23511
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_664a218a:

    # mc "You should stop stalking me through these cameras, [k]. One would think you're fixated, to say the least."
    mc "您该别再用这些摄像头偷拍我了，[k]。说真的，别人会以为您对我有什么执念。"

# game/events.rpy:23512
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_33c0bc77:

    # mc "Besides. I know what I'm doing already, no need to babysit me like that other time."
    mc "再说了。我清楚自己在做什么，不用像上次那样盯着我。"

# game/events.rpy:23513
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_2b7eba64:

    # k "As I said. The suspicious activity refers to the individual outside of the Academy. The camera will focus in just a moment..."
    k "就像我说的。所谓可疑活动，是指学院外的那个人。镜头马上就会拉近……"

# game/events.rpy:23520
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_a2e2a6e4:

    # mc "Hm? Who is that?" with d
    mc "嗯？那是谁？" with d

# game/events.rpy:23521
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_2ab759e3:

    # mc "Some sort of creep spying on our girls?"
    mc "是某种偷窥我们女学生的变态？"

# game/events.rpy:23522
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_62c5e670:

    # k "We don't know for certain."
    k "还不能确定。"

# game/events.rpy:23523
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_6ea30b8f:

    # k "However, the man seemed more interested on watching you, sir."
    k "不过，那个男人似乎对观察您更感兴趣，先生。"

# game/events.rpy:23524
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_9e6f11df:

    # mc "Me?"
    mc "我？"

# game/events.rpy:23525
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_a6aee776:

    # mc "Alright...? I'm weirdly flattered, but a creeps' a creep still."
    mc "好吧……？我莫名其妙地受宠若惊，但变态就是变态。"

# game/events.rpy:23526
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_7a92689d:

    # k "I don't think the man was lurking nearby as some sort of... sexual desire."
    k "我不觉得那个男人躲在附近是出于什么……性欲。"

# game/events.rpy:23527
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_86588432:

    # k "It is of my assumption that the man might be a spy."
    k "我的推测是，那个男人可能是间谍。"

# game/events.rpy:23528
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_672f97a4:

    # mc "A spy?!"
    mc "间谍？！"

# game/events.rpy:23529
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_e1946810:

    # k "Correct."
    k "正确。"

# game/events.rpy:23530
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_84138207:

    # k "As soon as Miss [em] arrived and interacted with you, the man pointed his phone device at the two of you and, by the looks of it, started to take pictures or record you and her."
    k "[em]小姐一出现并和您互动，那个男人就把手机对准了你们两个，从样子上看，开始拍照片或者录像。"

# game/events.rpy:23531
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_ae035e7b:

    # mc "A spy... Taking pictures of me and [em]."
    mc "间谍……拍我和[em]的照片。"

# game/events.rpy:23532
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_7077a83f:

    # mc "That's [mi]'s doing, I'm sure of it."
    mc "这肯定都是[mi]干的。"

# game/events.rpy:23533
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_9ae260e6:

    # k "I believe so as well, sir."
    k "我也这么认为，先生。"

# game/events.rpy:23534
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_fb2dc625:

    # k "I have been doing some investigation regarding your case with this... [mi]."
    k "关于您和[mi]的案子，我一直在做些调查。"

# game/events.rpy:23535
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_2d0cb97d:

    # k "It appears she has been meeting with lawyers and even going as far as looking to hire private detectives."
    k "看来她一直在和律师接触，甚至到了要聘请私家侦探的地步。"

# game/events.rpy:23536
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_430905e8:

    # k "If this man is to be one of her investigators, she might be preparing evidence to file a lawsuit against you in the near future."
    k "如果这个人是她的调查员之一，那她可能正在准备证据，准备近期起诉您。"

# game/events.rpy:23540
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_2d1ff407:

    # mc "Yeah... I knew this was going to happen at some point." with d
    mc "嗯……我就知道这事早晚会发生。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23541
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_7ff827da:

    # mc "So, what do we do now?"
    mc "那我们现在怎么办？"

# game/events.rpy:23543
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_040768d6:

    # k "The way I see it, you have two options."
    k "依我看，您有两个选择。"

# game/events.rpy:23544
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_30725cfe:

    # k "Option 1 is to try and be more discreet on how you perform and direct our... 'academic operations'."
    k "选择一，是尽量更隐蔽地执行和指导我们的……「学术活动」。"

# game/events.rpy:23545
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_26b2bedf:

    # k "That may prove to be a bit difficult, however, since the Board is ever so demanding. You can't neglect our main goal."
    k "不过这可能有点难，因为理事会要求极高。您不能荒废我们的主要目标。"

# game/events.rpy:23546
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_c1c2a9ec:

    # k "Option 2, is the one the President disclosed during your interviewing."
    k "选择二，就是理事长在您面试时透露的那一个。"

# game/events.rpy:23548
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_8faa71d9:

    # mc "Asking the Board for help, I assume?"
    mc "我猜是向理事会求助？"

# game/events.rpy:23550
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_e1946810_1:

    # k "Correct."
    k "正确。"

# game/events.rpy:23551
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_f002ddde:

    # k "I can continue my investigation on [mi]'s doings, and if you feel she's getting too close to the truth, all you have to do is to request the Board's aid."
    k "我可以继续调查[mi]的动向，如果您觉得她查得离真相太近了，您只要开口请求理事会的援助即可。"

# game/events.rpy:23552
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_2ea89e79:

    # k "They have several avenues to pursue as an attempt to either slow her down or stop her altogether."
    k "他们有好几种手段，可以设法拖慢她的进度，或者彻底把她拦下来。"

# game/events.rpy:23553
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_293cd68b:

    # k "The only caveat here is that the Board is only willing to help you, as long as you keep them satisfied with your performance."
    k "唯一的前提是，只要您用行动让他们满意，理事会才愿意帮您。"

# game/events.rpy:23555
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_17a7bf9c:

    # mc "Right. Keep the Board happy, and I keep my job. I know this part already."
    mc "明白。让理事会高兴，我就保住工作。这部分我很清楚。"

# game/events.rpy:23557
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_09adf456:

    # k "Yes. For now, that is all there is to report regarding the situation."
    k "是的。暂时关于这件事要汇报的就这些。"

# game/events.rpy:23559
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_d24146df:

    # k "Don't hesitate to ask the Board for aid, especially now that you find yourself in good standing with them."
    k "别犹豫去向理事会求助，尤其是在您现在和他们关系良好的时候。"

# game/events.rpy:23560
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_c134da11:

    # k "They will surely find a way to slow down her progress."
    k "他们肯定会想办法拖慢她的进度。"

# game/events.rpy:23562
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_b54e3293:

    # k "Even though the Board might not be very favorable to you as of this moment, I'm sure they still value the project enough to find a way to slow down [mi]'s progress."
    k "虽然就目前而言理事会可能对您不算友好，但我敢肯定他们仍然足够重视这个项目，会想办法拖慢[mi]的进度。"

# game/events.rpy:23563
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_4755f386:

    # k "Therefore, you shouldn't hesitate to ask for their aid."
    k "所以您不必犹豫，尽管开口求助。"

# game/events.rpy:23565
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_44a71b4a:

    # k "At the moment, your standing with the Board is not so favorable, so my advice would be to try and be careful with what you conduct our 'academic operations'."
    k "目前您在理事会的处境不算有利，所以我的建议是，执行我们的「学术活动」时要格外小心。"

# game/events.rpy:23566
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_249be624:

    # k "However, I'm sure that in a case of emergency, the Board would be willing to find a way to slow [mi]'s progress. All in an effort to keep the project going."
    k "不过我敢肯定，一旦出现紧急情况，理事会愿意想办法拖慢[mi]的进度。一切都是为了让项目继续下去。"

# game/events.rpy:23568
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_5f4c3b98:

    # mc "Got it. Thanks, [k]."
    mc "明白。谢谢你，[k]。"

# game/events.rpy:23570
translate schinese Lawsuit_Start_abea6102:

    # k "Of course, sir.\nIf the situation develops any further, I'll report it back to you."
    k "当然，先生。\n如果情况有任何进一步发展，我会向您汇报。"

# game/events.rpy:23667
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_c1862afd:

    # masa "{xpr}*whistling*" with d
    masa "{xpr}*吹口哨*" with d

# game/events.rpy:23675
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_988e3c21:

    # masa "... Hm?" with d
    masa "……嗯？" with d

# game/events.rpy:23678
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_6c17cbe7:

    # sot "{size=-8}Oh, sh...-!" with dquick
    sot "{size=-8}哦， 该……-！" with dquick

# game/events.rpy:23684
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_41f59a1c:

    # masa "Must've been the wind." with d
    masa "应该是风吧。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23687
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_ff675121:

    # sot "{size=-6}{xpr}*whispering*{/xpr} Damn, that was close!" with d
    sot "{size=-6}{xpr}*低声说*{/xpr} 靠，好险！" with d

# game/events.rpy:23698
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_e9e7b73c:

    # mc "Oh, it's that guy, [sot]. Is he trying to steal the office keys from the Janitor?" with d
    mc "哦，是那家伙，[sot]。他是不是想从保洁员那儿偷办公室钥匙？" with d

# game/events.rpy:23699
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_e1946810:

    # k "Correct."
    k "正确。"

# game/events.rpy:23700
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_8cd8e3f4:

    # k "Mr. [masaru.surname] has reported that the student, [sot] has been following him while trying to remain furtive. This is but one of his many attempts so far."
    k "[masaru.surname]先生报告说，学生[sot]一直试图秘密跟踪他。这还只是他至今为止的众多尝试之一。"

# game/events.rpy:23701
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_02de5414:

    # k "I was going to bring the issue to you before deciding to act."
    k "我本来想在采取行动之前先向您汇报这件事。"

# game/events.rpy:23702
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_444e5483:

    # k "I believe a strike would be fitting?"
    k "我觉得记一次过很合适？"

# game/events.rpy:23703
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_c544a18b:

    # mc "Hm... Yes, it would."
    mc "嗯……是的，很合适。"

# game/events.rpy:23704
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_9339cfa5:

    # k "As you wish, sir. I'll relay the information to Mr. [masaru.surname] to stop acting oblivious to it so that...-"
    k "如您所愿，先生。我会把情况转达给[masaru.surname]先生，让他别再装作没看见，以便……-"

# game/events.rpy:23705
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_8c19877f:

    # mc "Hold off on that, though."
    mc "不过先等一下。"

# game/events.rpy:23707
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_44a88d97:

    # k "... Of course, sir." with d
    k "……当然，先生。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23708
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_52726ec3:

    # mc "He's doing this because [ha] asked him to."
    mc "他这么做是因为[ha]拜托他做的。"

# game/events.rpy:23709
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_2de8fe10:

    # mc "So if he were to steal the keys, He'd give them to [ha]. Then she'd try to sneak in the office."
    mc "所以他要是偷到钥匙，就会交给[ha]。然后她就会试着溜进办公室。"

# game/events.rpy:23710
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_edf54e5d:

    # k "That's a likely outcome."
    k "这是很可能的结果。"

# game/events.rpy:23711
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_434d6f5b:

    # mc "Let's not do anything just yet, then. This might be useful."
    mc "那我们暂时先别做什么。这说不定有用。"

# game/events.rpy:23712
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_c1972e9e:

    # k "As you wish, sir."
    k "如您所愿，先生。"

# game/events.rpy:23714
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_5228c81d:

    # mct "(It's that guy, [sot]. I bet he's been trying to steal the office keys from the Janitor. Probably because of what [ha] asked of him the other day.)" with d
    mct "（是那家伙，[sot]。我敢肯定他一直在试着从保洁员那儿偷办公室钥匙。多半是因为前几天[ha]拜托他的事。）" with d

# game/events.rpy:23715
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_c0a894dd:

    # mct "(I'm sure [masa] has already seen him lurking about but hasn't done anything yet because no order was given.)"
    mct "（我敢肯定[masa]已经看到他在附近鬼鬼祟祟，但因为没有命令所以还没动手。）"

# game/events.rpy:23716
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_4620d576:

    # mct "(I could just strike the guy, but maybe this situation could prove useful.)"
    mct "（我可以直接给那家伙记过一次，但也许这个情况会有用。）"

# game/events.rpy:23717
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_ef50dedd:

    # mct "(If he were to steal the keys, he'd give them to [ha] and she'd try to sneak in to the office.)"
    mct "（如果他偷到钥匙，就会交给[ha]，然后她试着溜进办公室。）"

# game/events.rpy:23718
translate schinese Haruka_Sotaro_Stealth_2_1e3d4b61:

    # mct "(I think I won't do anything just yet...)"
    mct "（我想我暂时还是什么都不做……）"

# game/events.rpy:23767
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_4310c018:

    # mc "Okay, let's see what's going on here..." with d
    mc "好吧，让我们看看这里在搞什么……" with d

# game/events.rpy:23769
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_839189f8:

    # mc "Hm...{w} It seems [ay] is trying to get the attention of the class." with d
    mc "嗯……{w} 看来[ay]想吸引全班的注意力。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23776
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_d509a7cb:

    # mc "Hm..." with d
    mc "嗯……" with d

# game/events.rpy:23782
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_859f9bf6:

    # mc "They don't seem too interested though..." with d
    mc "不过他们看起来兴趣不大……" with d

# game/events.rpy:23783
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_31f5f602:

    # mc "I know how that feels, [ay]..."
    mc "我懂那种感觉，[ay]……"

# game/events.rpy:23785
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_53253257:

    # k "It would appear that Miss [ay] is teaching the class." with d
    k "看来是[ay]小姐在给全班上课。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23787
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_bb21ba01:

    # mc "'Teaching'?{w} And why is that? Where is the actual teacher?" with d
    mc "「上课」？{w} 为什么？真正的老师在哪？"with d

# game/events.rpy:23789
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_395e1fc4:

    # k "I must remind you yet again that our Academy doesn't have as many teachers as we would need in order to function properly." with d
    k "我必须再提醒您一次，我们学院的老师数量远不足以正常运转。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23791
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_1117bf5e:

    # k "However, exams are still being held at the end of each week, and the content of these exams still includes class subjects for which we don't have teachers."
    k "不过，每周结束时仍然会举行考试，而且考试内容依然包括那些我们没有老师的科目。"

# game/events.rpy:23793
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_6923eef4:

    # mc "... That doesn't seem very fair." with d
    mc "……这好像不太公平。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23795
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_473ec2d0:

    # k "You are correct." with d
    k "您说得对。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23797
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_e0b51dc4:

    # mc "{i}Riiight.{/i}{w} We don't do 'fair'." with d
    mc "{i}没——错。{/i}{w} 我们不讲『公平』。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23799
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_cd3390c0:

    # k "To further elaborate on the topic of [ay] taking the role of a teacher here..." with d
    k "关于[ay]在这里担当老师这件事，再补充说明一下……" with d

# game/events.rpy:23800
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_5d639551:

    # k "She was chosen a few days ago as the students' representative, due to her many qualities."
    k "几天前，她因为众多优点被选为学生代表。"

# game/events.rpy:23801
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_5f450651:

    # k "As a result, it would appear she is trying to help her fellow classmates keep up with said class subjects in order to not fail our weekly exams."
    k "因此，她似乎是在努力帮同学跟上那些科目的进度，以免每周考试不及格。"

# game/events.rpy:23804
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_082456df:

    # mc "And these weekly exams are important, I assume?" with d
    mc "而这些每周考试很重要，我想是吧？" with d

# game/events.rpy:23806
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_bf522f73:

    # k "Of course, sir.{w} It is not only our main method of grading our students, but for them, it is also a way to get their weekly income from the Academy." with d
    k "当然，先生。{w} 那不仅是我们给学生评分的主要手段，对他们来说，也是从学院领取每周收入的方式。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23808
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_f747ee10:

    # mc "Oh, they get paid to study here, right?" with d
    mc "哦，原来在这里上学是有工资的啊？" with d

# game/events.rpy:23809
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_c5e7557d:

    # mc "I see how it is.{w} It's like an extra incentive to do better... By any means necessary, I assume."
    mc "我明白了。{w} 就像一种让人更努力的额外动力……我猜是不惜一切手段。"

# game/events.rpy:23811
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_bda3b93a:

    # k "Precisely." with d
    k "正是。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23812
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_b8aa41dd:

    # k "It also makes them rely on our Academy for said income and not pursue other means of acquiring financial aid." with d
    k "这也让他们依赖学院来获取那笔收入，而不去寻求其他资助渠道。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23814
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_5abb6820:

    # mc "I assume those weekly exams are what determines their grades?" with d
    mc "我猜每周的考试就是决定他们成绩的东西？" with d

# game/events.rpy:23815
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_c9f53d39:

    # mc "And consequently, how much they get paid."
    mc "进而也决定他们能拿多少钱。"

# game/events.rpy:23817
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_e0de5165:

    # k "Yes, sir." with d
    k "是的，先生。" with d

# game/events.rpy:23819
translate schinese Ayumi_Teaching_01_4964ae19:

    # mc "Okay...{w} But that would mean the Academy wants them to fail, right?{w} Isn't it a bad idea to let [ay] teach the others?" with d
    mc "好吧……{w} 但这意味着学院是希望他们不及格，对吧？{w} 让[ay]来教其他人不是个糟糕的主意吗？" with d

# game/events.rpy:23821
